# CaaS Control — project context

WordPress plugin **Chaos as a Service**: configurable admin dashboard and front-end “menagerie” (companion agents, behaviors, and playful site hooks). PHP 7.4+, WordPress 6.0+, GPL-2.0-or-later. Text domain: `caas-control`.

## Layout

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `caas-control.php` | Constants, requires loader/activator/deactivator/main class, activation hooks, `caas_control_run()` |
| `includes/class-caas-control.php` | Orchestration: loads deps, registers all hooks via loader |
| `includes/class-caas-control-loader.php` | Collects and runs `add_action` / `add_filter` |
| `includes/class-caas-control-settings.php` | Single option `caas_control_settings`, defaults, sanitize, JS config |
| `includes/class-caas-control-features.php` | Cross-cutting WP hooks (404, login, WSOD, profiles, WooCommerce) |
| `includes/class-caas-control-maintenance.php` | Litter Box tools, AJAX maintenance, admin notices |
| `includes/class-caas-control-activator.php` / `deactivator.php` | Activation defaults, deactivation |
| `admin/class-caas-control-admin.php` | Menu, Settings API, asset enqueue, partial renders, `field_tip()` help markup |
| `admin/partials/global-menace.php` | Global Menace settings UI |
| `admin/partials/litter-box-care.php` | Sidekick + maintenance UI |
| `admin/partials/pro-breed-shop.php` | Pro toggle / dev shop UI |
| `admin/css/caas-control-admin.css` | Admin-only settings UI styles |
| `admin/js/caas-control-admin.js` | Maintenance AJAX, media picker (`caasControlAdmin`) |
| `admin/js/caas-control-editor.js` | Block editor companion assets |
| `public/class-caas-control-public.php` | Front-end CSS/JS, scroll-to-top scratching post markup (agent sprite + sisal post) |
| `public/js/caas-control-chaos.js` | Shared chaos runtime (admin + front when enabled) |
| `public/css/caas-control-public.css` | Shared styles |
| `assets/gpl-cat/` | Bundled GPL cat media: officer sprite (MP4/WebM/GIF/PNG via `default_cat_media_url()`), sit/judging clip (`judging_video_url()`), meow audio |
| `languages/` | i18n |
| `uninstall.php` | Deletes `caas_control_settings` and `caas_control_sidekick` user meta |

## Hook registration

Register hooks only in `includes/class-caas-control.php` through `Caas_Control_Loader`:

| Method | Responsibility |
|--------|----------------|
| `define_admin_hooks()` | `Caas_Control_Admin`, `Caas_Control_Maintenance` (AJAX, notices) |
| `define_public_hooks()` | `Caas_Control_Public` |
| `define_feature_hooks()` | `Caas_Control_Features` |

Do not register hooks ad hoc in the bootstrap or partials.

`define_feature_hooks()` wires `Caas_Control_Features`: 404 guilt (`template_redirect`), login hiss assets (`login_enqueue_scripts`), WSOD shutdown handler (`init`), user profile sidekick (`show_user_profile` / `edit_user_profile` + saves), WooCommerce order celebration (`init`).

## Settings and data

- **Site options:** one array option — `Caas_Control_Settings::OPTION_KEY` (`caas_control_settings`). Read with `Caas_Control_Settings::get_all()`; defaults in `defaults()`; all writes go through Settings API sanitize (`Caas_Control_Settings::sanitize()`).
- **Master switch:** `caas_enabled` (Global Menace → “Enable CaaS Control”). `Caas_Control_Settings::is_enabled()` gates PHP features, scroll-post markup, and user-profile admin assets. `should_load_chaos()` returns false when disabled.
- **Agents:** valid values `cat` (bundled GPL Pawtrol officer) and `custom` (URL in `custom_image_url`). Legacy emoji agents (`dog`, `mouse`, etc.) are coerced to `cat` in `get_all()` / `sanitize()`.
- **Timing:** `frequency_minutes` is one of `5`, `10`, `15` (invalid values reset in `get_all()`); `duration_seconds` is one of `5`, `10`, `30` (validated in `sanitize()`). JS timed behaviors use `durationSeconds` from config.
- **Bundled media:** `Caas_Control_Settings::bundled_gpl_cat_url()` picks the first readable file under `assets/gpl-cat/`. `default_cat_media_url()` and `judging_video_url()` wrap that for the officer sprite and sit/judging clip. `agent_media_is_video()` drives `<video>` vs `<img>` in PHP (`Caas_Control_Public::echo_agent_sprite()`) and mirrors JS `mediaUrlIsVideo()` / `appendAgentMedia()`.
- **Toggle groups:** `behavior_*` = timed companion antics (random scheduler in chaos JS). `enable_*` = event-driven features (404, publish gate, paw trail, scroll post, etc.)—wired in `Caas_Control_Features`, `Caas_Control_Public`, or chaos `init()` via `cfg.features.*`.
- **Form context:** partials pass hidden `_form_context` (`menace` or `pro`). Unchecked checkboxes are absent from POST; sanitize merges onto `get_all()`. `menace` updates `caas_enabled`, habitat/behavior/`enable_*` booleans (not `pro_enabled`); `pro` updates only `pro_enabled`.
- **Settings groups:** `caas_control_menace` (Global Menace), `caas_control_pro_dev` (Pro & Breed Shop). Both use the same option key and sanitize callback.
- **Per-user:** `caas_control_sidekick` user meta — Litter Box form (`maybe_save_sidekick()`, nonce `caas_control_sidekick`) and profile UI in `Caas_Control_Features` (not the settings array).
- **Chaos gating:** `Caas_Control_Settings::should_load_chaos( 'frontend' | 'backend' )` before enqueuing companion assets (requires `is_enabled()`). Backend also respects `habitat_specific_only`: chaos in wp-admin only on CaaS menu screens and the block editor (see `Caas_Control_Admin::should_load_admin_chaos()`).
- **Admin help UI:** settings labels use `Caas_Control_Admin::field_tip( $i18n_text )` (info button + tooltip). Markup: `.caas-control-tip`, `.caas-control-tip__trigger`, `.caas-control-tip__bubble`; open state `.is-open`. Styles in `caas-control-admin.css`; toggle/open behavior in `caas-control-admin.js` (works without `caasControlAdmin` localize).
- **Admin screens:** CaaS pages use `.wrap.caas-control-admin.caas-control-panel` with `.caas-control-section` blocks. Global Menace settings form adds `.caas-control-form` (scopes agent/custom-field JS). Profile sidekick UI reuses `field_tip()`; admin CSS/JS load on `profile` / `user-edit` when enabled (`Caas_Control_Admin::is_user_profile_screen()`).
- **Scroll post:** `Caas_Control_Public::render_scroll_post_button()` outputs fixed markup when `is_enabled()` and `enable_scroll_post`; chaos JS enhances the existing button (visibility, scratch animation, scroll-to-top). Gated by master switch even though assets use `should_load_chaos( 'frontend' )`.
- **Behavior preview (Global Menace):** `Caas_Control_Admin::behavior_preview_button()` outputs `.caas-control-behavior-preview` with `data-caas-behavior` slugs matching chaos JS (`walk`, `sit`, `follow`, `blockMouse`, `randomBlock`, `meow`). Admin enqueues chaos on settings pages even when full backend chaos is off, with `previewHarness: true` so `init()` skips the scheduler but exposes `window.caasControlPreviewBehavior`. Admin JS syncs agent/name/custom URL from the form before preview.
- **JS config:** `Caas_Control_Settings::chaos_config_for_js()` + asset helpers (`asset_url()`, bundled cat/judging URLs, `meowSoundUrl`). Includes `judgingVideoUrl`, `strings.judgingYou`, `behaviors.*`, `features.*`. Localized as `caasControlChaos` (contexts: `frontend`, `backend`, `block-editor`, `login`; admin may add `previewHarness`, `sidekick`, `isAdmin`). Settings screens also localize `caasControlAdmin` (maintenance AJAX, media upload, preview error strings).
- **Activation:** `Caas_Control_Activator` adds default `caas_control_settings` if the option is missing.

## Admin menu

Top-level slug: `caas-control` (capability `manage_options`). Subpages: same slug (Global Menace), `caas-control-care` (Litter Box), `caas-control-pro` (Pro shop).

## Adding behavior

- **New admin UI:** partial under `admin/partials/`, render method on `Caas_Control_Admin`, submenu in `register_menu()` if needed. Use `field_tip()` for non-obvious copy; wrap sections in `.caas-control-section` / `.caas-control-panel` to match Global Menace.
- **New PHP-only features (404, login, WSOD, Woo, etc.):** early-return with `Caas_Control_Settings::is_enabled()` before reading individual toggles.
- **New toggles:** add key to `Caas_Control_Settings::defaults()`, sanitize in `sanitize()` (`$bool_keys` or dedicated branch), expose in the right partial, and wire into `chaos_config_for_js()` or PHP feature checks as appropriate.
- **New front-end/admin JS behavior:** extend `caas-control-chaos.js` or editor/admin scripts (see `.cursor/rules/caas-control-javascript.mdc`); keep strings in PHP i18n via `chaos_config_for_js()` when shown to users.
- **New WordPress hooks (404, login, etc.):** `Caas_Control_Features` + register in `define_feature_hooks()`.
- **Maintenance / AJAX:** `Caas_Control_Maintenance`; action names `caas_control_*`, nonce `caas_control_maintenance` (see admin JS localize).
- **New PHP classes:** `includes/class-caas-control-*.php`, require in `load_dependencies()`, class name `Caas_Control_*`.

## Constants and prefix

Use `CAAS_CONTROL_*` from bootstrap (`CAAS_CONTROL_PLUGIN_DIR`, `CAAS_CONTROL_PLUGIN_URL`, `CAAS_CONTROL_VERSION`, etc.). Prefix hooks, options, AJAX actions, and nonces with `caas_control_`; menu/page slug `caas-control` where WordPress expects a slug.

## Scope of changes

Keep diffs minimal. Match existing WordPress Plugin Boilerplate–style structure. Do not rename the plugin folder or text domain unless explicitly requested.
